; ========================================
; ＞『花畑方面』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_17_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:我和蕾雅来到了花田。|#0204Adv07_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们打算在视野开阔的花田<br>寻找典狱长。|#0204Adv07_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:远眺整座山丘，繁花似锦。<br>在花丛之间……我看到了艾玛的身影。|#0204Adv07_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……蕾雅、希罗。|#0204Adv07_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的神情有些恍惚，<br>她只是坐在花田里，茫然遥望着天空。|#0204Adv07_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:天气这么好，待在这里确实很舒服。<br>艾玛，你是在这里采花吗？|#0204Adv07_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不……也没有。|#0204Adv07_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛面无表情地摇了摇头。<br>蕾雅似乎察觉到了什么，<br>凑近我低声说道。|#0204Adv07_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆コソリと

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.4
