@ModifyCharacterExtended Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:60,30 IdAndAppearance:Leia
@Wait WaitMode:0.8

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的状态，是不是有些奇怪？|#0204Adv07_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:她最近一直这样。|#0204Adv07_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我脑海中浮现艾玛近来的样子。|#0204Adv07_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

