[PrintTextModified Text:在限制活动期间，<br>我和艾玛必须在房间里独处。|#0204Adv07_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然我已经习惯了<br>尽量不去在意艾玛的存在……|#0204Adv07_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ぶつぶつ小声

[PrintTextModified Text:……住手，我不要这样，住手啊……|#0204Adv07_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:自从上次事件后，<br>艾玛开始频繁发呆。|#0204Adv07_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她时常喃喃自语，<br>嘴里低声嘀咕着什么。|#0204Adv07_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（到底在自言自语些什么……？）|#0204Adv07_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……只要大家都去死就好了……|#0204Adv07_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不对……这不是我的愿望……<br>明明我没有……|#0204Adv07_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:仔细听就会发现，<br>自言自语的内容很危险。|#0204Adv07_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（是因为压力导致魔女化加剧，<br>　她开始产生杀意了……？）|#0204Adv07_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

