[PrintTextModified Text:……她的状况越来越糟了。<br>得想点办法让她打起精神才行……|#0204Adv07_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长似乎不在这里。我们走吧。|#0204Adv07_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我刻意回避谈到艾玛，<br>率先离开了。|#0204Adv07_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0204Adv07_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:本来，我确信艾玛是魔女，<br>认为必须在她完全变成魔女之前杀掉她。|#0204Adv07_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但这真的正确吗？|#0204Adv07_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我的心情、我的行动，一切都充满了矛盾。|#0204Adv07_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

